# ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║  This file is COMMITTED and this repository is PUBLIC.                   ║
# ║                                                                          ║
# ║  It is a list of names, not values. Never put a real password, database  ║
# ║  string or key here — everything written below is published the moment   ║
# ║  it is pushed, and git keeps it in history even after it is deleted.     ║
# ║                                                                          ║
# ║  Real values go in:                                                      ║
# ║    • .env.local          for your own machine (git-ignored)              ║
# ║    • Vercel → Settings → Environment Variables   for the live site       ║
# ║                                                                          ║
# ║  Nothing reads this file. Editing it changes no deployment.              ║
# ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is git-ignored.

# --- Database (M2b) -------------------------------------------------------
# Local, via docker compose up -d mongodb:
MONGODB_URI=mongodb://localhost:27017
# MongoDB Atlas (Connect -> Drivers gives you this string):
# MONGODB_URI=mongodb+srv://USER:PASSWORD@cluster0.xxxxx.mongodb.net/?appName=Cluster0
MONGODB_DB_NAME=reserve

# Leave MONGODB_URI empty to run on in-memory storage in development.
# A production build refuses to start without it — bookings would not survive
# a restart, and failing loudly beats losing them quietly.

# --- Application ----------------------------------------------------------
# The public address of the site. Must be http(s) and carry no credentials:
# it is inlined into the client bundle and printed into every canonical tag.
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Super Admin panel. Defaults to "reserve-dev" in development; in production
# the panel refuses to open unless this is set to something else.
# SUPERADMIN_PASSWORD=

# --- Optional -------------------------------------------------------------
# SENTRY_DSN=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN=
